OL,3,GNEWSADelay to council reforms
OL,4,A'affecting budget process'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council report says delays to local
OL,7,Fgovernment reorganisation (LGR) is
OL,8,Faffecting its ability to set next
OL,9,Fyear's budget.
OL,11,FThe government initially said it wanted
OL,12,Fcouncils in Cambridgeshire to merge
OL,13,Finto larger unitary authorities by
OL,14,FApril 2028. However, the process has
OL,15,Fbeen delayed, with new councils not
OL,16,Fcoming on board until April 2029 at the
OL,17,Fearliest.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
