OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADelay to council reforms
OL,4,A'affecting budget process'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report being presented to Fenland
OL,7,FDistrict Council's cabinet on Monday
OL,8,Fsays the delay has had an impact on
OL,9,Fsetting the budget and on parking and
OL,10,Fregeneration projects.
OL,12,FIt says council officers have been
OL,13,Fworking towards the original LGR
OL,14,Fdeadline, and that had taken their
OL,15,Fattention away from other projects.
